[00:03.82] Blood droplets fall
[00:08.12] Blooms like a rose
[00:14.70] You call out my name
[00:20.44] My hands grasp your throat
[00:38.02] Teeth sink into ass
[00:43.66] Our heartbeats merge in tune
[00:50.34] All existence fades
[00:56.26] There is only me and you
[01:02.78] Now calm has conquered rage
[01:19.18] As night is raped by day
[01:26.12] Now the snake can sleep
[01:32.22] Its venom has been drained
